SCOPE

The licence above covers the original work in this repository: the TypeScript
source under src/, the build configuration and the documentation.

The game content — the sprites, tilemaps, sound effects and music under
public/assets/, and the datatables transcribed into src/data/ — comes from the
Retrospec Wizball remake source archive, which is distributed under the MIT
licence reproduced below. That notice travels with this repository as MIT
requires.

Note that the underlying game, Wizball (Sensible Software, 1987), and its names
and characters are not any contributor's to license. This is a non-commercial
fan port; see the "Licence" section of README.md.

